NCC Cadets at #ArmyHouse

#GeneralUpendraDwivedi, #COAS and #MrsSunitaDwivedi, President #AWWA, warmly welcomed National Cadet Corps NCC cadets at the ArmyHouse.

Interacting with the cadets, the COAS commended the pivotal role of the NCC in fostering national unity and social cohesion. He emphasised the values of discipline, perseverance, hard work and leadership as the foundation for shaping character and achieving excellence in life.

The COAS felicitated selected achiever cadets and shared insights from his own journey. He urged the cadets to imbibe India’s timeless values and strive for excellence in all walks of life. The occasion also provided an opportunity for the cadets to engage with the Indian Army's gallantry award winners & sportspersons, including Sub Maj & Hony Lt Sanjay Kumar, Param Vir Chakra, Olympians Sub Hokato Sema & Nb Sub Jaismine, igniting a spirit of aspiration & resolve.

